 #:seon.task{:name "check-rehearses-an-indexer-change-with-the-old-indexer", :plan "bin/seon check rehearses publication and adoption of the candidate in the RUNNING JVM, whose compiled indexer is the old one, so it refuses any change to what the indexer reads: lane task-tags' annotation change (:seon/tasks handles to quoted symbols) failed with `seon.fn/task-links` refusing its result (data/clusters/default/logs/operator-check-20261007T145415.659.edn), while the same candidate booted green in the throwaway JVM. The throwaway half never runs because the rehearsal refused first. Done when check rehearses an indexer change in the throwaway JVM against a copy or branch of the live store (new code adopting the live data), and an annotation-format change passes check. Read `seon.operator/check!` and `docs/research/agent-platform/2026-10-07/task-tags/task-tags-notes.md`."}
